<%# One image's detail panel (media library design spec §6) -- entirely
    `Admin::MediaLibrary::DetailComponent`'s own; this view only ever hands
    it the asset, the editing locale and the flash (a restore-via-Undo's
    "Restored …" notice, a refused delete's alert), the same "component owns the
    screen" shape `Admin::PostsController#show` already gives `Admin::
    PostFormComponent`. %>
<% content_for :title, @asset.title %>

<%= render Admin::MediaLibrary::DetailComponent.new(asset: @asset, locale: admin_locale, url_options: admin_url_options,
      notice: flash[:notice], alert: flash[:alert]) %>
